{"id":"716570823","kind":"article","title":"使用机器学习从解释性文本中生成优质的间隔重复卡片","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2DY7qsP5iHsiA5hxUHheV8hu7Xe96vdGyYX"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2024-08-27","updated":"2026-10-28","votes":16,"comment_count":1,"minutes":4,"chars":2149,"keywords":["间隔重复","机器学习","大型语言模型","记忆卡片","自动出题","教育技术"],"summary":"这则笔记梳理用机器学习从解释性文本生成间隔重复卡片的难点：选择要强化的概念与撰写卡片是两项不同任务；语言模型可能需要卡片原则、明确的考查角度和充足上下文，处理复杂材料仍有不足。作者列出更简单的生成、改写、等价性与剧透检测子任务，并汇集数据集、模型和自动出题研究作为后续阅读线索。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/716570823","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":3,"title":"其他尝试"},{"id":"sec-2","level":3,"title":"阅读队列"},{"id":"sec-3","level":3,"title":"坟场"},{"id":"sec-4","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-5","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"ft8ciYH7\">一个颇具挑战的问题。一些相关笔记：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"rmhMBvS1\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2VVmj24FLixtrijdAbkKty91JQruAaZGbHE6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GPT-4 在指导下，通常能够从解释性文本中为陈述性知识生成可用的间隔重复卡片</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup></li><ul><li data-pid=\"mI20px5g\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z62s1nNLEfhGbDmpb8Z7dZiYyi3kaSziuLVXd\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">对于卡片生成任务，选择要强化的目标概念，和为这些目标概念编写卡片，是两个独立的问题</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup></li><li data-pid=\"jD6cco6A\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zQ4E1DXZoZTTitsik89ZcvXMu8dQMkJzRUS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">将卡片生成任务定义为强化目标的过滤问题</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup></li><li data-pid=\"MzO-vMyi\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zrqgkr9n3eCMNsAPDsRozt3HLd8nRT5nVASc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">对于卡片生成任务，如果提供了编写卡片的原则，大型语言模型（LLM）的表现可能会有所提升</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup></li><li data-pid=\"WD6V4jZ-\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zomoPzCNzSi5GqtfTeVWgm7RjmiArjS8vvM5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">对于卡片生成任务，大型语言模型（LLM）经常需要额外的提示来确定需要强化何种角度</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup></li><li data-pid=\"zSU0JdmP\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5LQFLXHFLrb4nYAtLrB3JBzNyJng8fYHVJYN\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">对于卡片生成任务，如果提供了充足的上下文，大型语言模型（LLM）可能会表现得更好</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup></li></ul><li data-pid=\"4y7qMe3I\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zmrbnm683nVZi9ut63vsr8BwYKEtATA6e4B3\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">对于卡片生成任务，大型语言模型（LLM）缺乏为复杂概念材料编写卡片的模式</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup></li><li data-pid=\"Wg4OdZTl\"> LLM 可以完成的一些更简单的子任务：</li><ul><li data-pid=\"qIFF4n78\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zEhne31FD53eNQw3bpcuomfxMYL3s1qkhbF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GPT-3 能够产生间隔重复记忆卡片问题的简单变体</a></li><li data-pid=\"DFbQ9Jwf\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4A7LCXBAkAUH2uZ21JnNrBhJHCjkobFMyn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GPT-3 可以基于填空卡生成问答卡</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-8\"><a href=\"#ref-8\">[8]</a></sup></li><li data-pid=\"lR0XN6j0\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3r1Lqmf4W9KPU2scVDSdbafthRBisJgv3G6a\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GPT-4 或许可以判断两张卡片在功能上是否是等价的</a></li><li data-pid=\"EuUDFuZW\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3PxNiZC25rkdrbgig9zm6oYk9AAECVKySYKG\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GPT-4 或许可以判断一张卡片是否会剧透另一张卡片</a></li></ul><li data-pid=\"RbfB7Pmx\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6ZUDZaQrh43M64sHsZL48QZVKcFKQsTi4kTY\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">专家编写的卡片数据集将有助于开发卡片生成系统</a><br/> </li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-1\">其他尝试</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"ylVMrSHA\"> 来自 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3HA4Pzw3eyayQWh99237BuH9L577TFxzq1V2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">OpenAI</a> Sunny Chen 的 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://autonki.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://autonki.com</a></li><li data-pid=\"1-FM1atH\"> 使用 OpenAI GPT-3 API 的 Polar 和 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4xUYCRTU7uUjZhafKD3jAcn5u5mHsDJwPMcc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sana Labs</a></li><ul><li data-pid=\"MmDSExEA\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4xUYCRTU7uUjZhafKD3jAcn5u5mHsDJwPMcc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sana Labs</a> 使用公认高质量的内容/问题/答案数据<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://openai.com/blog/improving-language-model-behavior/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">微调</a> GPT-3</li></ul><li data-pid=\"1kI-cEh5\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zn9igQGgecLncBSpKbgv5123mC5YEAP3hnfP\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Ozzie Kirkby</a> 使用 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/iarfmoose/t5-base-question-generator\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iarfmoose/t5-base-question-generator · Hugging Face</a>（一个经过微调的 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://ai.googleblog.com/2020/02/exploring-transfer-learning-with-t5.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">T5</a> 模型）进行了一系列实验。</li><li data-pid=\"PPXXgK-P\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zUb4zm9zcMaRki1rhXLofjzzYciBrZrFqjC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Aithal, S. G., Rao, A. B., &amp; Singh, S. (2021). Automatic question-answer pairs generation and question similarity mechanism in question answering system. Applied Intelligence.</a> 使用了在 SQuAD 数据集上微调的 ProphetNet 模型从文本段落生成问题，并应用 BERT 模型来回答这些问题。</li><li data-pid=\"cg0K7Ycs\"> Steuer, T., Filighera, A., Meuser, T., &amp; Rensing, C. (2021). I Do Not Understand What I Cannot Define: Automatic Question Generation With Pedagogically-Driven Content Selection. ArXiv.</li><ul><li data-pid=\"koS9obYT\"> 一个基于BERT的模型，该模型配备了独立的内容选择机制</li><li data-pid=\"M1LT9UzY\"> 有价值的参考文献目录</li></ul><li data-pid=\"Kb5ZuAkN\"><a class=\"external\" href=\"https://www.r-bloggers.com/2024/01/comparing-gpt-4-3-5-and-some-offline-local-llms-at-the-task-of-generating-flashcards-for-spaced-repetition-e-g-anki/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"visible\">r-bloggers.com/2024/01/</span><span class=\"invisible\">comparing-gpt-4-3-5-and-some-offline-local-llms-at-the-task-of-generating-flashcards-for-spaced-repetition-e-g-anki/</span><span class=\"ellipsis\"></span></a></li><ul><li data-pid=\"tfXbNHoM\">简洁的提示词设计，但有一些系统的评估设计</li></ul></ul><h3 id=\"sec-2\">阅读队列</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"eWD8BD52\">A systematic review: Kurdi, G., Leo, J., Parsia, B., Sattler, U., &amp; Al-Emari, S. (2020). A Systematic Review of Automatic Question Generation for Educational Purposes. International Journal of Artificial Intelligence in Education, 30(1), 121–204. <a class=\"external\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s40593-019-00186-y\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"visible\">doi.org/10.1007/s40593-</span><span class=\"invisible\">019-00186-y</span><span class=\"ellipsis\"></span></a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-3\">坟场</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"N2i3jORq\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2FBdAnkR9BXc9YZE924sfFRXMKwmHFQAhLXv\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">日志：尝试使用 GPT-3 生成间隔重复卡片</a></li></ul><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><h2 id=\"sec-4\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"garFoUkr\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"404257681\" href=\"#/post/404257681\">间隔重复记忆系统（Spaced repetition memory system）</a></li><li data-pid=\"mJt6rNlK\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1660865898\" href=\"#/post/1660865898\">以想法为中心的记忆系统</a></li><li data-pid=\"dr1_JnB7\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"397245681\" href=\"#/post/397245681\">写好间隔重复记忆卡片很难</a></li><li data-pid=\"ED0nO42i\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"656760808\" href=\"#/post/656760808\">GPT-4 在指导下，通常能够从解释性文本中为陈述性知识生成可用的间隔重复卡片</a></li><li data-pid=\"pk3gr1qL\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"656354899\" href=\"#/post/656354899\">对于卡片生成任务，选择要强化的目标概念，和为这些目标概念编写卡片，是两个独立的问题</a></li><li data-pid=\"r3KVLWj_\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"639267420\" href=\"#/post/639267420\">将卡片生成任务定义为强化目标的过滤问题</a></li><li data-pid=\"7F7trm7Q\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"644435780\" href=\"#/post/644435780\">对于卡片生成任务，大型语言模型（LLM）经常需要额外的提示，来确定从何种角度制卡</a></li><li data-pid=\"tcnE68LO\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"645670312\" href=\"#/post/645670312\">对于卡片生成任务，如果提供了充足的上下文，大型语言模型（LLM）可能会表现得更好</a></li><li data-pid=\"wf3kneTF\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"656355546\" href=\"#/post/656355546\">对于卡片生成任务，大型语言模型（LLM）缺乏为复杂概念材料编写卡片的模式</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-5\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"J3OxF5wO\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 claude-3.5-sonnet，校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2DY7qsP5iHsiA5hxUHheV8hu7Xe96vdGyYX\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Using machine learning to generate good spaced repetition prompts from explanatory text (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquot